    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_drugs_medicinal_botanicals): Named materia medica (castoreum, ginseng, cubebs, scammony, maidenhair, liquorice juice, quassia, cocculus indicus, serpentary, asafoetida, cantharides, hellebore, pipsissewa, ipecacuanha) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 16 rows, 1809–1830. Series: KEW_CUST 4 ×16. Units: Lbs. (Pounds) ×16. Top routes: Canada → England ×6; Canada → London ×5; Canada → Great Britain ×4; Canada → Other English Ports ×1."@en ;
